    "text": "<article class=\"card\" aria-labelledby=\"drill-title\">\n  <header>\n    <h2 id=\"drill-title\">Lower-layer symbols</h2>\n    <time datetime=\"2026-08-17\">17 Aug 2026</time>\n  </header>\n  <p>Hold <kbd>Lower</kbd> then tap <kbd>[</kbd> to emit a bracket.</p>\n  <footer><a href=\"/drills/lower\">Start drill &rarr;</a></footer>\n</article>"
